  "worked_solution": "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 6 & 2 \\\\ 5 & -3 & 7 \\\\ 1 & 8 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}-4\\cdot 3 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,6\\cdot (-1) & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2\\cdot 4 \\\\ 5\\cdot 3 & + & (-3)\\cdot (-1) & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,7\\cdot 4 \\\\ 1\\cdot 3 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,8\\cdot (-1) & + & (-2)\\cdot 4\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-12 & + & (-6) & + & 8 \\\\ 15 & + & 3 & + & 28 \\\\ 3 & + & (-8) & + & (-8)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-10 \\\\ 46 \\\\ -13\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
